Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses; the per-file list (author,
source, license) is in ATTRIBUTION.md. Icons are drawn in code and the app icon is original;
demo audio is synthesised in code. The egui default fonts (Ubuntu-Light, Hack, Noto Emoji, Emoji
Icon Font) ship inside the egui crate under their own open licenses (see ATTRIBUTION.md).

